  "notes": "ProS3 uFL view (u.FL connector shown). Skipped: USB-C, u.FL antenna, VBAT battery connector (only +/- marks), buttons. Floating callouts (RGB LED DATA IO18, DETECT 5V PRESENT IO33 VBUS, BATTERY VOLTAGE IO10 VBAT, LDO2 PWR EN IO17) are internal signals not tied to pins. GND pins have a white square silkscreen mark instead of text. Silkscreen TX/RX on IO43/IO44 duplicates the printed TX/RX tags."
